<title>UK: Commerzbank ups Corex linked bond to 600 mln marks.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank ups Corex linked bond to 600 mln marks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 600 million marks from 500 million marks, lead manager Commerzbank AG said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *600 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY    06.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE   COREX LINKED  ISS PRICE  99.70     PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFM	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>NOTES  *LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 100 MILLION MARKS ON 28.JAN.97</p>
<p>	 **PAYS AN ANNUAL FLOATING COUPON LINKED TO THE REX 10-</p>
<p>	   YEAR YIELD SUBINDEX TIMES 68 PCT. WITH FIRST COUPON OF</p>
<p>	   4.25 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
